('10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002', '2022-2025 Ground Effect & Budget Cap Era', 2022, 2025, '1.6L V6 Turbo Hybrid + 120kW MGU-K + MGU-H', 'Venturi Ground Effect underfloor tunnels, 18-inch Pirelli low-profile wheels, wheel wake deflectors', 798, 'E10 10% bio-ethanol fuel', 135.0, 'Re-introduction of ground effect downforce to facilitate close wheel-to-wheel overtaking; introduced strict FIA financial cost cap regulations.')
